Harbor Cafe 1.0.0 / pxa-harbor-cafe

The cafe scenery, patrons, coffee equipment, tables, chairs, order bubbles,
coastline, waves, boat, birds, lighthouse, flowers, lighting, icon, gameplay,
economy, save format, documentation and application tests were authored for
this project. No downloaded sprites, photographs, recordings or music are used.
All original Harbor Cafe material is dedicated under CC0-1.0; see LICENSE.

The app links the workspace's frozen common/pocket-play CC0-1.0 runtime,
including its original 5x7 font and quiet synthesized triangle-wave tones.
The native drawing test reproduces that CC0 font. Simulator integration uses
the frozen common/pocket-game test transport as a read-only dependency.
The SDK, simulator, compiler toolchains and transport dependencies retain their
own licenses and are not relicensed by this application.
